<?xml version="1.0"?>
<!--
  robot: kmjh_arm_v3_kg1_articulated_v3
  consumers: CAD Viewer; Isaac import/motion evidence separately owned by 069.
  canonical: this XML, authored directly. assets.py computes meshes/numbers only.
  units: metres, kilograms, seconds, radians. Right handed; Base +Z up.
  dimensional sources: v1 kinematics.json and parameters.json; v3 bodies.json/STL;
  MP9 rev1 assembly.json g_to_link6_local. Detailed input hashes: provenance.json.
  MP10 J5 neck decision made by user; standalone NOT_INTEGRATED into MP9 full arm.
  MP11 exploded illustrations are not dimensional sources. Ring review deferred.
  zero: J1..J6=0 is displayed CAD [15,-50,70,15,25,-10] deg, not physical zero.
  angle: geometric radians = URDF delta radians + displayed CAD angle.
  positive: right hand about child/joint +Z for J1, +Y for J2/J3/J5,
  +X for J4/J6, as existing CAD axes; no motor/encoder sign inferred.
  Base: physical root, CAD world frame; visual meshes/Base.stl in metres.
  Link1..Link6: physical frames at corresponding Jn CAD display origin;
  axes are corresponding v1 R_child columns, parent joint Jn.
  KG1: fixed F-group only, G frame from MP9; parent KG1_mount.
  G +X=Link6 +Y, G +Y=Link6 +Z, G +Z=Link6 +X; mount at Link6 +X0.028m.
  KG1_A: jaw A, FLAT pad and its screws; parent KG1_slide_A, G-parallel axes.
  KG1_B: jaw B, FLAT pad and its screws; parent KG1_slide_B, G-parallel axes.
  KG1_R: pinion, spline, horn and screws; parent KG1_pinion.
  KG1_R origin is G(0,0,.026)m; axes rotated about +Y by -20/13.5rad at zero.
  zero: all joint positions0 preserve CAD u20mm/gap40mm; FLAT pads.
  one logical command opening_m is full finger gap0..0.094m, not raw joint q.
  d=opening_m/2-.020m; slide_A=d, slide_B=d, pinion=-d/.0135rad.
  slide_A positive opens toward G-X; slide_B positive opens toward G+X.
  pinion positive is right hand about G+Y; CAD absolute pinion angle=-u/.0135.
  slide_B mimics slide_A multiplier1 offset0; pinion multiplier-74.07407407407408
  offset0. Physical movable joints9, independent coordinates7 including6 arm.
  CAD source verify_gripper.place/sign_check supplies signs, centre and ratio.
  No contact gear constraint is implied by URDF affine mimic or command coupling.
  tool0: frame only, no mass/geometry; KG1 +Z0.103m, nominal grasp point,
  J6 axial distance0.131m. Not a calibrated physical TCP.
  visual: one combined mesh per physical link, saved in its own frame in metres;
  visual origin identity, scale1. A/B closed-pose meshes; R closed mesh centered
  at its rotation axis. Joint origins encode u20 exactly once, without mesh offsets.
  Arm47 CAD bodies; KG1 six printed parts and
  41 purchased-item reference primitives from existing MP9 assembly computation.
  inertial/collision origins: physical-link local AABB centre, zero RPY.
  inertia: uniform solid AABB m*(b*b+c*c)/12, computed from actual saved STL.
  ASSUMPTION: arm masses [1.2,.65,.7,.65,.4,.35,.2]kg are old starter guesses.
  ASSUMPTION: KG1 mass0.1842kg is split across F/A/B/R, never duplicated on F.
  ASSUMPTION: source printed masses preserved; servo55g split F54.8/Rspline.2g;
  horn3g R, rods13.19g F; screws9g split F16/A4/B4/R9 of33 screw primitives.
  These unweighed group masses sum184.2g; full arm total4.3342kg.
  ASSUMPTION: COM uses actual group saved-mesh AABB, not original closed-pose COM.
  ASSUMPTION: every inertia and COM is a box placeholder, not physical properties.
  ASSUMPTION: collision is one AABB per physical group; may create false contacts,
  including fixed guide-rod box versus moving jaws. No self-contact acceptance.
  ASSUMPTION: gripper effort10N/0.2Nm, velocity.02m/s/2rad/s and damping.05,
  friction0 are starter simulation caps, not STS3215 or gearbox ratings.
  ASSUMPTION: J1/J2/J3/J4/J6 limits +/-170deg delta are illustrative only.
  ASSUMPTION: J5 delta[-135,85]deg = CAD absolute[-110,110]deg from MP9 sampled
  screening, not continuous collision proof or a physical safe operating range.
  ASSUMPTION: effort [3,6,5,2,2,1]Nm, velocity0.5rad/s, damping0.05 are starter
  simulation caps, not MKS/reducer ratings. Friction0 is also assumed.
  UNKNOWN: physical zeros, motor signs, CAN IDs, encoder scales, measured ratios.
  NOT_RUN in 068: Isaac/USD/physics/contact/gravity/trajectory/RL/hardware.
  No physics acceptance is inherited from 065, which uses the frozen older model.
-->
